      "summaries": {
        "en": "Open-LLM-VTuber is an open-source framework that turns any LLM into a voice-interactive Live2D avatar, enabling hands-free, real-time conversations. Its key innovation is combining voice activity detection, interruption handling, and local Live2D rendering with LLM backends like Ollama. You can run it entirely offline on desktop or mobile, making it ideal for building AI companions, virtual assistants, or interactive characters without cloud dependencies.",
        "zh": "Open-LLM-VTuber 是一个开源框架，能将任意大语言模型（LLM）转化为支持语音交互的 Live2D 虚拟形象，实现免提、实时的对话体验。其核心技术亮点在于：集成了语音活动检测、语音打断功能以及本地 Live2D 渲染，并与 Ollama 等 LLM 后端无缝对接。你可以在桌面端或移动端完全离线运行，无需依赖云端服务。这为构建 AI 伴侣、虚拟助手或互动角色提供了便捷的实践路径——只需准备一个 LLM 和 Live2D 模型，即可快速打造属于自己的可对话虚拟形象。",
        "es": "Open-LLM-VTuber is an open-source framework that turns any LLM into a voice-interactive Live2D avatar, enabling hands-free, real-time conversations. Its key innovation is combining voice activity detection, interruption handling, and local Live2D rendering with LLM backends like Ollama. You can run it entirely offline on desktop or mobile, making it ideal for building AI companions, virtual assistants, or interactive characters without cloud dependencies.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "Open-LLM-VTuber stands out for ai, ai-companion, and ai-vtuber in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Open-LLM-VTuber is an open-source framework that turns any LLM into a voice-interactive Live2D avatar, enabling hands-free, real-time conversations. Its key innovation is combining voice activity detection, interruption handling, and local Live2D rendering with LLM backends like Ollama. You can run it entirely offline on desktop or mobile, making it ideal for building AI companions, virtual assistants, or interactive characters without cloud dependencies.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/Open-LLM-VTuber/Open-LLM-VTuber for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
