      "summaries": {
        "en": "Headroom is a compression library that reduces token usage by 60-95% when sending tool outputs, logs, files, or RAG chunks to LLMs, without sacrificing answer quality. It works by intelligently pruning redundant or low-information content while preserving key semantics. You can integrate it as a Python library, a proxy, or an MCP server to transparently compress context in any LLM pipeline—ideal for cutting costs and latency in agentic workflows or retrieval-augmented generation.",
        "zh": "Headroom是一个上下文压缩库，可在将工具输出、日志、文件或RAG块送入大语言模型前，将token用量减少60-95%，同时保持答案质量不变。其核心原理是智能识别并去除冗余或低信息量内容，保留关键语义，而非简单截断。用户可通过三种方式使用：作为Python库直接调用、作为透明代理拦截并压缩LLM请求、或作为MCP服务器集成到现有工具链中。该工具对智能体工作流或检索增强生成场景尤其有价值，能显著降低API成本和延迟。",
        "es": "Headroom is a compression library that reduces token usage by 60-95% when sending tool outputs, logs, files, or RAG chunks to LLMs, without sacrificing answer quality. It works by intelligently pruning redundant or low-information content while preserving key semantics. You can integrate it as a Python library, a proxy, or an MCP server to transparently compress context in any LLM pipeline—ideal for cutting costs and latency in agentic workflows or retrieval-augmented generation.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "headroom stands out for agent, ai, and anthropic in real-world workflows.",
          "what": "Headroom is a compression library that reduces token usage by 60-95% when sending tool outputs, logs, files, or RAG chunks to LLMs, without sacrificing answer quality. It works by intelligently pruning redundant or low-information content while preserving key semantics. You can integrate it as a Python library, a proxy, or an MCP server to transparently compress context in any LLM pipeline—ideal for cutting costs and latency in agentic workflows or retrieval-augmented generation.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/chopratejas/headroom for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
